Screen
/ PlangOS's side of the screen. Host plang starts this (wsl … /opt/plang/plang Screen) and reads
/ its stdout: every frame of the browser goes up as one line. Input from the host's screen
/ comes down on stdin, one line per event. Ends when the host closes the pipe.
- start browser 'https://www.mbl.is', size 1920x1080, on frame call Frame, write to %browser%
- on input call Input
- stop %browser%

Frame
- write out %!data%

Input
- send %!data% to %browser%
